      "voice": "Charon",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "term-divided-government",
      "file": "audio/us-midterm-tech-2026/02-term-divided-government.wav",
      "sec": 4.259,
      "text": "民主黨拿下國會兩院，白宮還是共和黨，這叫分裂政府。",
      "hash": "17a83e123050",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "term-preemption",
      "file": "audio/us-midterm-tech-2026/03-term-preemption.wav",
      "sec": 4.692,
      "text": "凌駕州法，是聯邦訂一套 A I 規則，直接取代各州的法。",
      "hash": "5632a4c528c9",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "who-decides",
      "file": "audio/us-midterm-tech-2026/04-who-decides.wav",
      "sec": 5.628,
      "text": "先看誰主導。行政和法院管的，國會換手短期不直接改變。",
      "hash": "fce98a04e017",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-regulation",
      "file": "audio/us-midterm-tech-2026/05-ai-regulation.wav",
      "sec": 5.175,
      "text": "聯邦 A I 法想凌駕州法，法律界多認為新國會很難過關。",
      "hash": "0bcbc9a0b540",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "data-center-ballots",
      "file": "audio/us-midterm-tech-2026/06-data-center-ballots.wav",
      "sec": 5.41,
      "text": "選舉日全美四十一項資料中心公投，四十案選擇限制或否決。",
      "hash": "d8646a111f5a",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "governors-pause",
      "file": "audio/us-midterm-tech-2026/07-governors-pause.wav",
      "sec": 5.173,
      "text": "三位新州長想暫停新資料中心，分析多認為延後而非取消。",
      "hash": "7f93d37690ef",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "chip-export-controls",
      "file": "audio/us-midterm-tech-2026/08-chip-export-controls.wav",
      "sec": 4.653,
      "text": "對中晶片出口管制算兩黨共識，新國會預期審查更嚴。",
      "hash": "75008b931585",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "chip-credit-48d",
      "file": "audio/us-midterm-tech-2026/09-chip-credit-48d.wav",
      "sec": 5.443,
      "text": "美國蓋晶片廠可抵稅三十五趴，但要年底前開工，延長案還沒過。",
      "hash": "c0e539fab0c2",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "crypto-clarity",
      "file": "audio/us-midterm-tech-2026/10-crypto-clarity.wav",
      "sec": 4.44,
      "text": "加密貨幣由誰管的法案沒過，民主黨擬重提更嚴版本。",
      "hash": "4830d5c594d1",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "science-budget",
      "file": "audio/us-midterm-tech-2026/11-science-budget.wav",
      "sec": 4.898,
      "text": "白宮要砍科學基金會預算五十五趴，民主黨接手後預期回補。",
